["<div class=\"sina-header\" id=\"sina-header\"></div>", "<div class=\"sina-header-inner\"></div>", "<div class=\"sina-nav\"></div>", "<ul class=\"nav-list\"></ul>", "<li class=\"first\"></li>", "<a>新浪首页</a>", "<li></li>", "<a>新闻</a>", "<li></li>", "<a>体育</a>", "<li></li>", "<a>财经</a>", "<li></li>", "<a>娱乐</a>", "<li></li>", "<a>科技</a>", "<li></li>", "<a>博客</a>", "<li></li>", "<a>图片</a>", "<li></li>", "<a>专栏</a>", "<li class=\"last\"></li>", "<a class=\"more\">更多</a>", "<i class=\"icon icon-arrow\"></i>", "<div class=\"sina-client\"></div>", "<div class=\"sina-client-tl\"></div>", "<a class=\"more\">移动客户端</a>", "<i class=\"icon icon-arrow\"></i>", "<div class=\"TAP14\" id=\"SI_User\"></div>", "<div class=\"ac-rgst\"></div>", "<a class=\"msg-link\">注册</a>", "<div class=\"ac-login\"></div>", "<div class=\"ac-login-cnt\"></div>", "<a class=\"\"></a>", "<span class=\"thumb\"></span>", "<img src=\"//i.sso.sina.com.cn/images/login/thumb_default.png\"></img>", "<span class=\"log-links\">登录</span>", "<div class=\"main-content w1240\"></div>", "<div class=\"path-search\"></div>", "<div class=\"path\"></div>", "<a class=\"channel-logo\"></a>", "<div class=\"channel-path\">正文</div>", "<a>新浪体育</a>", "<span class=\"spliter\">></span>", "<a>篮球-NBA</a>", "<span class=\"spliter\">></span>", "<a>洛杉矶快船</a>", "<span class=\"spliter\">></span>", "<h1 class=\"main-title\">乔治28分约翰逊22+10 快船大胜送马刺九连败</h1>", "<div class=\"top-bar-wrap\" id=\"top_bar_wrap\"></div>", "<div class=\"top-bar ani\" id=\"top_bar\"></div>", "<div class=\"date-source\"></div>", "<span class=\"date\">2023年11月21日 11:26</span>", "<a class=\"source ent-source\">新浪体育</a>", "<div class=\"page-tools\"></div>", "<span class=\"tool-icon tool-des-fs first\"></span>", "<a>缩小字体</a>", "<span class=\"tool-icon tool-ins-fs\"></span>", "<a>放大字体</a>", "<span class=\"tool-icon tool-fav\"></span>", "<a>收藏</a>", "<span class=\"tool-icon tool-wb\"></span>", "<a>微博</a>", "<span class=\"tool-icon tool-wx\"></span>", "<a>微信</a>", "<span class=\"tool-icon tool-share\"></span>", "<a>分享</a>", "<span class=\"tool-icon tool-cmt\"></span>", "<a></a>", "<span class=\"num\">0</span>", "<div class=\"article-content-left\"></div>", "<div class=\"article\" id=\"artibody\"></div>", "<div class=\"img_wrapper\"></div>", "<img src=\"//k.sinaimg.cn/n/sports/crawl/117/w550h367/20231121/5b49-5da69be2e71782548619c0254ab7c70d.jpg/w700d1q75cms.jpg?by=cms_fixed_width\"></img>", "<p>北京时间11月21日，洛杉矶快船队客场挑战圣安东尼奥马刺队，本场比赛乔治和莱昂纳德联手贡献49分，带领快船队124比99大胜马刺。</p>", "<p>此役乔治拿下28分6助攻5篮板，莱昂纳德21分4篮板3助攻，哈登13分10助攻，鲍威尔19分5篮板，泰斯19分7篮板。</p>", "<p>马刺队方面，凯尔登-约翰逊22分10篮板5助攻，科林斯12分3篮板2抢断，文班亚马9分3篮板4助攻，奥斯曼17分。</p>", "<p>比赛开始之后，双方打得有来有回，科林斯连续低位单打，乔治利用中投予以回应。随着比赛的进行，威少开始带队连续反击，打出一波18-5攻击波之后，将分差拉大到两位数。</p>", "<p>尽管此后马刺队在防守端做出一些改变，但是依然无法限制莱昂纳德的发挥。最后一节也基本沦为了垃圾时间。</p>", "<p>最终马刺队以99比124惨败，遭遇九连败。</p>", "<p>（珅葳）</p>", "<div class=\"show_statement\">声明：新浪网独家稿件，未经授权禁止转载！</div>", "<div class=\"keywords\" id=\"keywords\"></div>", "<label>关键词 :</label>", "<a>保罗·乔治</a>", "<a>考瓦伊·莱昂纳德</a>", "<a>马刺</a>", "<div class=\"rc-20180203\"></div>", "<a></a>", "<img src=\"//n.sinaimg.cn/products/article2017/latest/zwbtmprom.png\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\"></img>", "<div class=\"blk-related clearfix\" id=\"tab_related\"></div>", "<div class=\"tab-related-wrap\"></div>", "<div class=\"tab-related\" id=\"tab_related_btn\"></div>", "<a class=\"cur\" id=\"tab01_btn01\">相关新闻</a>", "<a id=\"tab01_btn02\">相关微博</a>", "<div class=\"tab-cont-related\"></div>", "<div id=\"tab01_cont01\"></div>", "<div class=\"ty-feed-card-container\" id=\"tycard_list\"></div>", "<div class=\"cardlist-a__loading\">加载中</div>", "<div class=\"article-content-right\"></div>", "<div class=\"blk01 clearfix wrap_55a07552_9f6c_12b3_4f25_921db3cc5584\" id=\"j_wrap_55a07552_9f6c_12b3_4f25_921db3cc5584\"></div>", "<div class=\"tit\"></div>", "<h3>推荐阅读</h3>", "<ul class=\"wrap-pictxt clearfix\"></ul>", "<div class=\"blk04 clearfix wrap_8018e0e5_aec8_75bb_49ec_6f13f0593654\" id=\"j_wrap_8018e0e5_aec8_75bb_49ec_6f13f0593654\"></div>", "<div class=\"tit\"></div>", "<h3>阅读排行榜</h3>", "<div class=\"blk08 clearfix wrap_894980cb_ad47_ac8b_4b9e_a4f65e6b70fb\" id=\"j_wrap_894980cb_ad47_ac8b_4b9e_a4f65e6b70fb\"></div>", "<div class=\"tit\"></div>", "<h3>体育视频</h3>", "<a class=\"more\"></a>", "<div class=\"blk06 clearfix wrap_6cd3d224_0387_17b4_4429_9d95ad0adbb7\" id=\"j_wrap_6cd3d224_0387_17b4_4429_9d95ad0adbb7\"></div>", "<div class=\"tit\"></div>", "<h3>精彩图集</h3>", "<a class=\"more\"></a>", "<div class=\"blk08 clearfix wrap_a0ff4cae_adf2_578f_4c55_bbefe76ea2b3\" id=\"j_wrap_a0ff4cae_adf2_578f_4c55_bbefe76ea2b3\"></div>", "<div class=\"tit\"></div>", "<h3>秒拍精选</h3>", "<div class=\"footer-wrap clearfix\"></div>", "<div class=\"footer-cont\"></div>", "<p class=\"msg icon\"></p>", "<a>新浪体育意见反馈留言板</a>", "<p class=\"text\"></p>", "<a>新浪简介</a>", "<span class=\"line\">|</span>", "<a>广告服务</a>", "<span class=\"line\">|</span>", "<a>About Sina</a>", "<a>联系我们</a>", "<span class=\"line\">|</span>", "<a>招聘信息</a>", "<span class=\"line\">|</span>", "<a>通行证注册</a>", "<a>产品答疑</a>", "<span class=\"line\">|</span>", "<a>网站律师</a>", "<span class=\"line\">|</span>", "<a>SINA English</a>", "<p class=\"copyright\">Copyright © 1996-2023 SINA Corporation</p>", "<p>All Rights Reserved 新浪公司</p>", "<a>版权所有</a>", "<div class=\"right-side-ad\" id=\"rightSinaFuyiArea\"></div>", "<div class=\"tit\"></div>", "<h3>新浪扶翼</h3>", "<a class=\"more\"></a>", "<div class=\"page-right-bar\"></div>", "<a class=\"right-bar-btn btn-home\">新浪首页</a>", "<i class=\"ani pulse infinite\"></i>", "<a class=\"right-bar-btn btn-related\">相关新闻</a>", "<a class=\"right-bar-btn btn-toTop fadeOut\">返回顶部</a>"]